   (a) download, install and run the Software, for Personal Use;
   (b) read and study the source code;
   (c) make Modifications, and run them, for Personal Use;
   (d) submit Modifications to the Licensor as Contributions;
   (e) share unmodified copies of the Software with others, free of charge,
       provided this licence file travels with every copy;
   (f) fork the official repository on GitHub and push Modifications to that
       fork solely to develop, review and submit Contributions; and
   (g) make and run Modifications, including at your place of work, solely
       to prepare a Contribution. That is not Business Use and is not a
